   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stem_html": "<p>The temperature <span data-math=\"t\">t</span>, in degrees Fahrenheit, of a cup of coffee that was poured and then forgotten for <span data-math=\"m\">m</span> minutes is represented in the table below</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n  <thead></thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"row\">Time in minutes</th>\n      <td>\n        0\n      </td>\n      <td>\n        15\n      </td>\n      <td>\n        25\n      </td>\n      <td>\n        40\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"row\">Temperature</th>\n      <td>\n        185°F\n      </td>\n      <td>\n        155°F\n      </td>\n      <td>\n        140°F\n      </td>\n      <td>\n        120°F\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n <br> <p>What was the average rate of change from when the cup was poured to 40 minutes later?&nbsp;</p>",
